# Use case: heavy metals in the Meuse floodplain

## Setup

> **Not run in CI.** GeoFrame is a private sibling project, so GitHub Actions cannot fetch it.
> Run this notebook locally with a GeoFrame checkout:
>
> ```
> GEOSTATEX_GEOFRAME_PATH=/path/to/geoframe livebook server notebooks/meuse_case.livemd
> ```
>
> or headlessly, to check that every cell works:
>
> ```
> GEOSTATEX_GEOFRAME_PATH=/path/to/geoframe elixir scripts/run_livemd.exs notebooks/meuse_case.livemd
